"Migrated from AppConfig to AppLauncher and replaced utilities "
"withutils.decorators, utils.translation, and shortcuts where applicable."
msgstr ""
"تم الترحيل من Django AppConfig إلى Horilla AppLauncher واستبدال أدوات Django "
